              </p>

              <div className="rounded-xl border border-white/15 bg-white/[0.04] backdrop-blur-xs p-4 sm:p-5 max-w-md shadow-[0_4px_24px_rgba(0,0,0,0.25)]">
                <p className="text-hb-xs font-bold text-[#FF8A50]">
